    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389860/extras/3a49c2ca5c9a6b9f625c7bcf4bdfb988.avif?t=1743133185\" width=600 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389860/extras/bc352206baa8af814db7b81e48afd654.webp?t=1743133185\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389860/extras/2852d9ed770685efcd97dc6f992d642f.avif?t=1743133185\" width=600 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u7537\u4e3b\u89d2\u963f\u9005\u662f\u4e2a\u64c5\u957f\u505a\u6ce1\u8299\u7684\u70d8\u7119\u5e08\u5085</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u4ed6\u4f9b\u517b\u524d\u5973\u53cb\u8003\u516c\uff0c\u7ed3\u679c\u5bf9\u65b9\u4e0a\u5cb8\u5f53\u5929\u5c31\u628a\u4ed6\u7529\u4e86</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u540c\u65f6\u4ed6\u4e0a\u73ed\u7684\u5496\u5561\u5e97\u4e5f\u53d1\u4e0d\u51fa\u5de5\u8d44\uff0c\u6fd2\u4e34\u5012\u95ed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u7ecf\u5386\u4e86\u4e8b\u4e1a\u548c\u7231\u60c5\u53cc\u91cd\u6253\u51fb\uff0c\u4ed6\u9010\u6e10\u53d8\u5f97\u6d88\u6c89</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u5c31\u5728\u6b64\u65f6\uff0c\u4e00\u4f4d\u7231\u5403\u6ce1\u8299\u7684\u5973\u5b69\u51fa\u73b0\u5728\u4ed6\u7684\u9762\u524d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u8fd9\u6bb5\u5403\u6ce1\u8299\u3001\u505a\u6ce1\u8299\u7684\u604b\u7231\u6545\u4e8b\u5c31\u6b64\u5f00\u59cb\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389860/extras/eb8eac301b01691ca5273471ea320e8e.webp?t=1743133185\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb